BT 1 0 0 1 0 135.888 Tm .956 Tw 18 TL /F4 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (2023 Bar Q: Diego, a cancer survivor, filed an application for a life insurance policy with) Tj T* 0 Tw 5.552 Tw (Garantiya Insurance Company \(GIC\). He delivered his application and insurance) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.078769 Tw (premium to Gabriela, the officer of GIC in charge of approving life insurance policies.) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.616571 Tw (Gabriela then approved the application of Diego on June 1, 2020. On January 30, 2023,) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.898154 Tw (Diego died in a vehicular accident. When the heirs of Diego claimed the insurance) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.912 Tw (proceeds, GIC denied the claim on the ground that Diego had concealed the fact of his) Tj T* 0 Tw .263143 Tw (illness. Moreover, Gabriela knew about the illness of Diego but also concealed it from GIC.) Tj T* 0 Tw (Is the denial of the insurance claim by GIC proper? Discuss.) Tj T* ET
