BT 1 0 0 1 0 207.804 Tm .947294 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: No, the denial is improper and the heirs may recover because the insurer is deemed to have) Tj T* 0 Tw (known the illness through its approving officer and cannot claim concealment.) Tj  T* .94275 Tw (Under Secs. 26 to 28 and 31 concealment is neglect to communicate a known material fact the) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.562 Tw (other has no means of ascertaining, judged by probable influence on underwriting, while) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.569 Tw (knowledge of an agent in charge of approval is knowledge of the insurer and Sec. 33 waives) Tj T* 0 Tw (inquiry neglected where the fact was knowable.) Tj  T* .7424 Tw (Here Gabriela, the officer in charge of approving life policies, knew of the cancer history when) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.12925 Tw (she approved the application on June 1, 2020, so GIC had the means of ascertaining and is) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.288615 Tw (charged with that knowledge, and death by later vehicular accident confirms materiality is not) Tj T* 0 Tw (judged by the event.) Tj  T* 1.055143 Tw (There is no concealment against GIC, waiver and estoppel bar avoidance, and the claim denial) Tj T* 0 Tw (fails so proceeds must be paid.) Tj T* ET
