BT 1 0 0 1 0 441.804 Tm .362769 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (Marine Insurance includes: \(a\) Insurance against loss of or damage to: \(1\) Vessels, craft,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.254 Tw (aircraft, vehicles, goods, freights, cargoes, merchandise, effects, disbursements, profits,) Tj T* 0 Tw .058909 Tw (moneys, securities, choses in action, instruments of debts, valuable papers, bottomry, and) Tj T* 0 Tw .718154 Tw (respondentia interests and all other kinds of property and interests therein, in respect to,) Tj T* 0 Tw .8208 Tw (appertaining to or in connection with any and all risks or perils of navigation, transit or) Tj T* 0 Tw .6012 Tw (transportation, or while being assembled, packed, crated, baled, compressed or similarly) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.787636 Tw (prepared for shipment or while awaiting shipment, or during any delays, storage,) Tj T* 0 Tw .6816 Tw (transhipment, or reshipment incident thereto, including war risks, marine builder's risks,) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.461846 Tw (and all personal property floater risks; \(2\) Person or property in connection with or) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.1324 Tw (appertaining to a marine, inland marine, transit or transportation insurance, including) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.283429 Tw (liability for loss of or damage arising out of or in connection with the construction,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.745538 Tw (repair, operation, maintenance or use of the subject matter of such insurance \(but not) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.281231 Tw (including life insurance or surety bonds nor insurance against loss by reason of bodily) Tj T* 0 Tw .973846 Tw (injury to any person arising out of ownership, maintenance, or use of automobiles\); \(3\)) Tj T* 0 Tw .788727 Tw (Precious stones, jewels, jewelry, precious metals, whether in course of transportation or) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.7312 Tw (otherwise; and \(4\) Bridges, tunnels and other instrumentalities of transportation and) Tj T* 0 Tw .96 Tw (communication \(excluding buildings, their furniture and furnishings, fixed contents and) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.408615 Tw (supplies held in storage\); piers, wharves, docks and slips, and other aids to navigation) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.9664 Tw (and transportation, including dry docks and marine railways, dams and appurtenant) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.456364 Tw (facilities for the control of waterways. \(b\) Marine protection and indemnity insurance,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.204615 Tw (meaning insurance against, or against legal liability of the insured for loss, damage, or) Tj T* 0 Tw 4.373333 Tw (expense incident to ownership, operation, chartering, maintenance, use, repair, or) Tj T* 0 Tw .719077 Tw (construction of any vessel, craft or instrumentality in use of ocean or inland waterways,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.7536 Tw (including liability of the insured for personal injury, illness or death or for loss of or) Tj T* 0 Tw (damage to the property of another person.) Tj T* ET
