BT 1 0 0 1 0 189.804 Tm 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: All three acts were unlawful as done, and only the surcharge can still be cured.) Tj  T* 2.904923 Tw (The controlling rules are Sec. 365, which bars charging, demanding, or receiving any rate) Tj T* 0 Tw .851077 Tw (deviating from the last filing. Sec. 370 absolutely prohibits any off-policy rebate, special favor,) Tj T* 0 Tw .767143 Tw (or unstated inducement to the insured or its employee. Sec. 366 permits a higher-than-filed rate) Tj T* 0 Tw .39975 Tw (on a specific risk only upon a written application stating reasons, filed with and approved by the) Tj T* 0 Tw (Commissioner.) Tj  T* .492923 Tw (Applied here, the twenty-percent discount is deviation regardless of motive, the unstated cash to) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.227077 Tw (the client's manager is a rebate, and the thirty-percent surcharge was charged without the) Tj T* 0 Tw (required reasoned written approval.) Tj  T* 2.723077 Tw (The discount and the inducement therefore stand as violations, while only the surcharge is) Tj T* 0 Tw (curable through a Sec. 366 application filed and approved before use.) Tj T* ET
