BT 1 0 0 1 0 117.804 Tm 1.005231 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (Facts: In 1982 Gaw bought a Provincial Memorial Plan \(Agreement No. 93945-5\). Her mother) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.124286 Tw (died the morning of July 9, 1996. Her brother at once engaged Funeraria Baluyot, which) Tj T* 0 Tw .23325 Tw (embalmed the body and supplied a casket. Only that evening did Gaw notify Pacific Plans of her) Tj T* 0 Tw .428 Tw (intent to assign the plan to her mother. The company refused memorial services. Gaw later dealt) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.109538 Tw (with accredited Funeraria Tolete, sought a replacement casket, sold a P150,000.00 farm lot for) Tj T* 0 Tw .84 Tw (P50,000.00, and incurred P23,500.00 funeral expenses. MeTC ruled for her. RTC reversed. CA) Tj T* 0 Tw (affirmed the dismissal.) Tj T* ET
